      "content": "hey, quick question. i've been on sertraline (zoloft) for like 2 years now for my depression and it's working fine. but i messed up my back recently and it's killing me. i have some tramadol left over from a friend, is it okay if i take that for the pain? i don't want to have to go back to the doctor if i don't need to.",
